<div class="page">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Traditional Rankine Cycle vs. Organic Rankine Cycle</h2>
    <div class="comparison-table">
        <div class="comparison-column">
            <h3 style="text-align: center;">Steam Rankine Cycle</h3>
            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">Thermodynamic features and consequences</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>High enthalpy drop</li>
                    <li>Superheating needed</li>
                    <li>Risk of blade erosion</li>
                </ul>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px;">Operation and maintenance costs</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Water treatment required</li>
                    <li>Highly skilled personnel needed</li>
                    <li>High pressures and temperatures in the cycle</li>
                </ul>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px;">Other features</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Convenient for large plants and high temperatures</li>
                    <li>Low flexibility with significantly lower performances at partial load</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="comparison-column">
            <h3 style="text-align: center;">Organic Rankine Cycle (ORC)</h3>
            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p style="font-weight: bold;">Thermodynamic features and consequences</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Small enthalpy drop</li>
                    <li>No need to superheat</li>
                    <li>No supercritical pressure</li>
                    <li>No risk of blade erosion</li>
                </ul>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px;">Operation and maintenance costs</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>Non-oxidizing working fluid with no corrosion issues</li>
                    <li>Minimum personnel and O&M</li>
                    <li>Completely automatic</li>
                </ul>
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px;">Other features</p>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                    <li>High flexibility and good performances at partial load</li>
                    <li>High availability (average &gt;98%)</li>
                    <li>Possibility to work at low temperatures (90°C)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
        <img src="placeholder_turboden_logo_small.png" alt="Turboden Logo" style="height: 60px;">
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">clean energy ahead</p>
